  "title": "Presentationality: everything experienced is experienced now",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d477adf9-fc5f-48f7-8a16-e7d7a542f963",
      "text": "Phenomenal experience generates an island of presence in the flow of physical time. Whatever is experienced is experienced now, because phenomenal content carries a representation of temporal internality, a window of presence.",
